  "description": "Same Hatfield Pretorius / Francis Baard grid, with lane-use markings at every intersection: kerb lane left + straight, middle lanes straight, median lane straight + right. At Pretorius & Jan Shoba the kerb lane is left-turn only. Cars pick their movement a block ahead and change into a lane that allows it.",
