    "distanceSource": "Uniform 245 m block spacing, as specified. Because every block is the same length, the green wave offset chain is a constant step: 245 m / 13.89 m/s = 17.6 s per intersection at the 50 km/h target speed.",
    "demandSource": "Sinusoidal fluctuation between min and max, 300 s period, midpoint equal to the flat demand this scenario used before fluctuation was added.",
